BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Every carrier-side and audit-side speaker lands on the same root mechanic. The invoice is priced on billable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (weight, not scale weight, and billable weight is whichever is larger: actual weight or dimensional weight. UPS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (walks it as a three-step routine. You weigh on a scale, compute DIM from length times width times height,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (and take the greater of the two. For a multi-package shipment, you total the billable weight across every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (parcel [dp5xVhpuf64 @ 00:01:31]. The official FedEx packing guide says the same thing in plain language:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (many carriers compare actual weight with DIM weight and charge the higher. Charges are based on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (external length times width times height of the sealed package. Internal measurements only tell you whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (the product fits [OpAC2Ev8SH0 @ 00:01:33]. S3 Stores explains why the rule exists at all. If shipping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (charge tracked only actual weight, a rival could paralyze a network within three days by shipping large) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (empty boxes from every location. So the carrier defines billable weight as a function of both values, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (reads the price off its tables by destination and service method [q9kvSNRcgfs @ 00:01:28]. For an auditor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (every line on a carrier invoice is only as defensible as the dimensions and weight behind it. Every rerate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (starts by rebuilding that comparison package by package.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The second point of agreement is that the base rate is no longer where the money hides. FedEx APAC tells) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (shippers that the base rate and fuel surcharge are the predictable pieces. The other fees fall into) Tj ET
