BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (handling for fragile or oddly shaped goods, dangerous goods, remote-area delivery, and address correction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm ([KB4Xoe9MLWk @ 00:01:45]. Joe Wilkinson of Intelligent Audit, a former FedEx strategic pricing analyst,) Tj ET
