BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (double digits once surcharges are counted. Base rate commonly sits in the high 20s or 30 percent of total) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (spend, and a 50 percent base share would be extremely high [d3jQIelSHJM @ 00:23:42]. Wilkinson points) Tj ET
