BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 516.00 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 493.77 Tm (The fastest way to lose is procedural. The senior-homeowner guide reports deadlines as short as 30 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.55 Tm (from the date on the assessment notice, and missing by a single day forfeits the year entirely, so the date) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.32 Tm (goes on the calendar in two places the moment the notice lands [LopTSxbolHY @ 00:07:10]. Roy flags a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.10 Tm (nastier trap inside an already-filed Georgia appeal: when the county sends a 30-day notice of assessment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.87 Tm (change, ignoring it forfeits the appeal, because the county is asking the owner to accept its partial cut; Roy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 417.65 Tm (refiles and keeps asking for the original number, as on 409 Main Street in Hiram, where the county moved) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 402.42 Tm (from $77,600 to roughly $73,000 against a $60,000 ask [oIIj8lWBYVY @ 00:08:18]. Roy also reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.20 Tm (hand-delivered paperwork in some counties simply never showed up, so every filing needs a date-stamped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.97 Tm (receipt. Lane Property Tax Advocates adds a payment trap: paying the prior year late past January 31 can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 356.75 Tm (impair the right to arbitration or litigation, and the protest deadline is May 15 or 30 days after county notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 341.52 Tm ([ePPknD36YQc @ 00:01:41]. Jimmy's firm keeps one staffer checking deadlines every day across Illinois's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.30 Tm (102 counties [tHXC3Ph5z0Q @ 00:41:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.07 Tm (Filing is not free of downside. Roy warns that the Paulding and Douglas appeal forms state outright that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.85 Tm (filing creates a review of the county's value, so a new roof or deck the assessor finds on the visit gets added) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.62 Tm (back [oIIj8lWBYVY @ 00:05:10]. Jimmy adds that pulled permits give the assessor the right to reassess) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 265.40 Tm (off-cycle, that finished basements routinely sit on the record as unfinished, and that the move when an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.17 Tm (assessor knocks asking to look around is to say you do not speak English [tHXC3Ph5z0Q @ 00:38:55].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.95 Tm (Wins also invite retaliation. Roy reports Douglas County appealed six of eighteen properties Roy cut in one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.72 Tm (day; cuts of 10 to 15 percent rarely draw court, but 45 to 75 percent wins draw a Superior Court appeal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.50 Tm (citing the same boilerplate about inadequate weight given to uniformity [oIIj8lWBYVY @ 00:54:21]. Whoever) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 189.27 Tm (appeals pays $300 to $500 in court fees, Roy's attorney bills about $350 an hour, and most cases settle in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.05 Tm (mediation. The floodplain house Roy dropped from $107,050 to $32,000, a 70 percent cut, was dragged to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.82 Tm (court for 2012 and again for 2013 [oIIj8lWBYVY @ 00:21:06].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 143.60 Tm (The contingency math needs auditing before anyone builds a book on it. George Evers's small-account pitch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 128.37 Tm (says an $87,000 bill cut to $50,000 saves the client $35,000 and earns $11,000 at 35 percent, then restates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.15 Tm (the savings as $37,000 in the same breath; the 20-room hotel example books an $84,000 commission by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.92 Tm (treating the $240,000 income drop itself as client savings [7CfK4x3Fijc @ 00:01:41]. Roy's collections lag is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 82.70 Tm (the real cash-flow killer: 2012 Douglas County appeals were still unsettled in 2014, and Roy cannot collect a) Tj ET
