BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (pricing removes upfront cash risk, but the percentage decides how hard and how long the provider keeps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (working.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.60 Tm (Whether downside risk is required to win in shared savings splits the field. On Garrett Schmitt's) Tj ET
