BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.15 Tm (some 'skin in the game' but not a 100% backstop, and John Ford simply said no; moderator Dr. Katherine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (Schneider called the link between risk and success 'a little bit of a reverse causation' [UEDbkKJ-9Xk @) Tj ET
